        <mxCell id="170" value="&lt;b&gt;COST &amp; RESOURCE OPTIMIZATION (FinOps)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;2-Duplicate Early Exit&lt;/b&gt;: Saves 90%+ server compute and network bandwidth per crawl&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Batch Gemini Translation&lt;/b&gt;: 10 jobs per prompt cuts API costs &amp; rate limits by 90%&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Skip Reprocessing&lt;/b&gt;: Existing records with &lt;code&gt;title_mr IS NOT NULL&lt;/code&gt; never re-prompted&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Pure Vanilla CSS&lt;/b&gt;: Zero runtime JavaScript CSS overhead; minimal bundle size" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontColor=#1E293B;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
